source_quote:
For each finding, include:
- a short English title;
- a brief explanation of the conflict;
- the original Chinese text that proves the issue;
- a location marker with document name and page number.

- the original Chinese text that proves the issue;
- a location marker with document name and page number.
`input/extracted_text/` contains page-labeled UTF-8 text extracted from the PDFs for easier search.
